  "body": "**What.** Option B of item 1. Restart Claude Code on the laptop with `CLAUDE_CODE_DISABLE_BG_SHELL_PRESSURE_REAP=1` in its environment, then start the watcher.\n\n**Why.** Digest, item 1B. Release builds on the laptop (T97, T112, T125, T151) have stopped the watcher under memory pressure.\n\n**Acceptance (each can fail).**\n- The variable is set in the session's environment.\n- The watcher is still running at the end of the laptop's next long run or build, and its fetches cover the whole window. A watcher stopped again fails this check.\n\n**Files.** [comms_watch.py](https://github.com/nmoinvaz/choptuik-large-d/blob/main/comms_watch.py)",
